              R. Blackwell,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Max+Kelly"} Max Kelly
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/John+Power"} John Power
              = succeed "," do
                %em Two-dimensional monad theory
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0022-4049%2889%2990160-6"} doi
          %p The convention about lax morphisms for coalgebras is discussed in §2.3 of:
          %ul
            %li#LS
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Stephen+Lack"} Stephen Lack
